<p>I've kind of wanted to post a tale about talking to my author avatar, mostly bc my author avatar is supposed to be me within the Foundation universe and there's a level of meta-level control my author avatar has over the narrative.</p>
<p>This one's specifically about how I felt a bit unsure of writing happy things for the site, and how I really shouldn't be unsure about writing things I like and I know I'm good at. Sadness has it's place and is good, but I'm no good at writing sadness and I like happy things more anyway, so I should stick to that instead of trying to force myself to write sadness. It also explains what kind of meta-level control Chibi has, sort of.</p>

